#: assets/js/admin-settings.js:280
msgid "Developer Mode is off by default on purpose — while it’s on, every visitor’s browser keeps checking the server, which is fine for staging but adds real load on a busy live site. Turn it on while you’re testing, then switch it off when you’re done. It also turns itself off automatically after 12 hours, just in case."
